{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-phase6col001",
    "name": "Phase 6 — Messaging, AI Chatbot & Telegram",
    "description": "Test toàn bộ API Phase 6:\n- Conversations: tạo hội thoại (findOrCreate), xem danh sách, escalate, bot-mode\n- Messages: CRUD tin nhắn trong conversation\n- Telegram: webhook handler, link token cho staff\n- WebSocket (Socket.IO): hướng dẫn test thủ công\n\n**Thứ tự chạy:**\n1. [Setup] Đăng nhập\n2. [Conversations] CRUD hội thoại\n3. [Messages] Gửi và đọc tin nhắn\n4. [AI Bot] Kiểm tra mode BOT → escalate\n5. [Telegram] Link account + webhook\n6. [Error Cases] Các trường hợp lỗi\n\n**WebSocket test (ngoài Postman):**\n```\nwscat -c ws://localhost:8080/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=websocket \\\n  --header 'Authorization: Bearer <token>'\n# Sau khi kết nối:\n{ \"type\": 2, \"data\": [\"join_conversation\", { \"conversationId\": \"<id>\" }] }\n{ \"type\": 2, \"data\": [\"send_message\", { \"conversationId\": \"<id>\", \"content\": \"Xin chào!\" }] }\n```\n\n**Lưu ý Gemini AI:**\n- Cần GEMINI_API_KEY trong .env\n- Bot sẽ tự trả lời và có thể tự escalate khi cần tư vấn chuyên sâu\n\n**Lưu ý Telegram:**\n- Cần TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN và TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_URL trong .env\n- Dùng ngrok để expose localhost cho Telegram webhook",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",             "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ownerAccessToken",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "staffAccessToken",    "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customerAccessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "storeId",             "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "staffId",             "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "conversationId",      "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "messageId",           "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "telegramLinkToken",   "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "[Setup] Xác thực",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login Customer",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "if (b.data?.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('customerAccessToken', b.data.access_token);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer_p4@glowora.vn\",\n  \"password\": \"Customer@123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Login Owner",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "if (b.data?.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('ownerAccessToken', b.data.access_token);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner_p4@glowora.vn\",\n  \"password\": \"Owner@123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. [Manual] Set storeId và staffId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/app", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["app"] },
            "description": "Thủ công: Điền storeId (ACTIVE store từ Phase 4) và staffId vào collection variables.\nstoreId cần là store đã ACTIVE và có ít nhất 1 staff."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[Conversations] CRUD hội thoại",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4. Create/FindOrCreate Conversation",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Has conversation id', () => pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('id'));",
            "pm.test('Has mode field (BOT/HUMAN)', () => pm.expect(['BOT','HUMAN']).to.include(b.data.mode));",
            "pm.test('Default mode is BOT', () => pm.expect(b.data.mode).to.equal('BOT'));",
            "if (b.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('conversationId', b.data.id);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": \"<customer-id-from-me-endpoint>\",\n  \"storeId\": \"{{storeId}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. List All Conversations",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Has items and total', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('items');",
            "  pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('total');",
            "});"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. List Store Conversations (uses x-shop-id)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('All conversations belong to the store', () => {",
            "  b.data.items.forEach(c => pm.expect(c.storeId).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get('storeId')));",
            "});"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}" },
              { "key": "x-shop-id", "value": "{{storeId}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/store", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "store"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Get Conversation by ID (with messages)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Has messages array', () => pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('messages'));",
            "pm.test('Has customer info', () => pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('customer'));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "{{conversationId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Escalate to Human",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "if (b.data) {",
            "  pm.test('Mode is HUMAN or null (already HUMAN)', () => {",
            "    pm.expect(b.data === null || b.data.mode === 'HUMAN').to.be.true;",
            "  });",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}" },
              { "key": "x-shop-id", "value": "{{storeId}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/escalate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "escalate"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. Set Bot Mode",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Mode is BOT', () => pm.expect(b.data.mode).to.equal('BOT'));",
            "pm.test('assignedStaffId is null', () => pm.expect(b.data.assignedStaffId).to.be.null);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}" },
              { "key": "x-shop-id", "value": "{{storeId}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/bot-mode", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "bot-mode"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[Messages] Tin nhắn REST",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "10. Get Messages in Conversation",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Has items and total', () => {",
            "  pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('items');",
            "  pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('total');",
            "});",
            "if (b.data?.items?.length > 0) {",
            "  pm.collectionVariables.set('messageId', b.data.items[0].id);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "messages"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "11. Create Message (REST — không qua WebSocket)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Has message id', () => pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('id'));",
            "pm.test('Has senderType', () => pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('senderType'));",
            "if (b.data?.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('messageId', b.data.id);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Xin chào! Giá massage bao nhiêu ạ?\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "messages"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "12. Get Message by ID",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('ID matches', () => pm.expect(b.data.id).to.equal(pm.collectionVariables.get('messageId')));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages/{{messageId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "messages", "{{messageId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "13. Mark Message as Read",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('isRead is true', () => pm.expect(b.data.isRead).to.be.true);",
            "pm.test('readAt is set', () => pm.expect(b.data.readAt).to.not.be.null);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{ownerAccessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"isRead\": true\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages/{{messageId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "messages", "{{messageId}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[Telegram] Staff Link & Webhook",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "14. Generate Telegram Link Token for Staff",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200 hoặc 201', () => pm.expect([200, 201]).to.include(pm.response.code));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Has linkToken', () => pm.expect(b.data).to.have.property('linkToken'));",
            "if (b.data?.linkToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('telegramLinkToken', b.data.linkToken);",
            "console.log('Telegram link URL:', `https://t.me/<BOT_USERNAME>?start=${b.data?.linkToken}`);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{staffAccessToken}}" },
              { "key": "x-shop-id", "value": "{{storeId}}" }
            ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/store-staff/me/telegram-token", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["store-staff", "me", "telegram-token"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "15. [Simulate] Telegram /start Webhook (link token)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('ok is true', () => pm.expect(b.data?.ok ?? b.ok).to.be.true);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": {\n    \"chat\": { \"id\": 123456789 },\n    \"text\": \"/start {{telegramLinkToken}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/telegram/webhook", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["telegram", "webhook"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "16. [Simulate] Staff Reply via Telegram",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const b = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('ok is true', () => pm.expect(b.data?.ok ?? b.ok).to.be.true);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": {\n    \"chat\": { \"id\": 123456789 },\n    \"text\": \"Chào khách hàng! Tôi có thể giúp gì cho bạn?\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/telegram/webhook", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["telegram", "webhook"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "17. [Simulate] Telegram Webhook - No Active Conversation",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200 (always OK to Telegram)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": {\n    \"chat\": { \"id\": 999999999 },\n    \"text\": \"Hello bot\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/telegram/webhook", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["telegram", "webhook"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[WebSocket] Hướng dẫn test Socket.IO",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "WS-INFO: Cách test Socket.IO",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api"] },
            "description": "WebSocket test với wscat (npm install -g wscat):\n\n1. Kết nối:\n```\nwscat -c \"ws://localhost:8080/socket.io/?EIO=4&transport=websocket\" \\\n  --header \"Authorization: Bearer <customerAccessToken>\"\n```\n\n2. Join conversation:\n```\n42[\"join_conversation\",{\"conversationId\":\"<conversationId>\"}]\n```\n\n3. Gửi tin nhắn (AI Bot sẽ tự trả lời):\n```\n42[\"send_message\",{\"conversationId\":\"<conversationId>\",\"content\":\"Giá massage bao nhiêu?\"}]\n```\n\n4. Nhận events:\n- message_received: { id, content, senderType: 'CUSTOMER'|'STAFF'|'BOT', sender }\n- mode_changed: { conversationId, mode: 'HUMAN' } (khi Gemini escalate)\n\n5. Test escalation:\n```\n42[\"send_message\",{\"conversationId\":\"<id>\",\"content\":\"Tôi cần tư vấn y khoa chuyên sâu\"}]\n# Gemini sẽ reply rồi escalate → staff nhận Telegram alert\n```\n\nLưu ý:\n- Server xác thực JWT tại handshake (token trong header Authorization hoặc auth.token)\n- Nếu token invalid → server ngắt kết nối ngay\n- join_conversation trả { joined: true } nếu thành công"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[Error Cases]",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "18. [Error] Get Conversation Not Found",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations/non-existent-id-0000", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations", "non-existent-id-0000"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "19. [Error] Get Messages for Non-existent Conversation",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{customerAccessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/messages?conversationId=non-existent-conv-0000",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["messages"],
              "query": [{ "key": "conversationId", "value": "non-existent-conv-0000" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "20. [Error] Telegram Webhook Without Message",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 200 (Telegram always gets OK)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"update_id\": 123456\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/telegram/webhook", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["telegram", "webhook"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "21. [Error] Unauthenticated Access to Conversations",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('Status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/conversations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["conversations"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
